1
00:00:00,080 --> 00:00:01,050
What if the Sun

2
00:00:01,050 --> 00:00:02,940
vanished right now?

3
00:00:02,940 --> 00:00:04,470
you'd keep sunbathing

4
00:00:04,470 --> 00:00:06,300
for EIGHT minutes.

5
00:00:06,380 --> 00:00:08,290
Your sunshine is a delivery...

6
00:00:08,290 --> 00:00:09,700
sent eight minutes ago.

7
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:11,090
Switch the Sun off,

8
00:00:11,090 --> 00:00:12,065
and the light already

9
00:00:12,065 --> 00:00:13,020
on the road...

10
00:00:13,020 --> 00:00:14,200
keeps arriving.

11
00:00:14,280 --> 00:00:16,800
Even its PULL is that slow.

12
00:00:16,800 --> 00:00:18,680
So Earth keeps circling...

13
00:00:18,680 --> 00:00:19,600
nothing.

14
00:00:19,740 --> 00:00:20,710
Then...

15
00:00:21,130 --> 00:00:22,300
lights out.

16
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:23,161
Earth flies off

17
00:00:23,161 --> 00:00:24,540
in a straight line,

18
00:00:24,540 --> 00:00:26,667
at thirty kilometres a second...

19
00:00:26,737 --> 00:00:27,918
and you wouldn't even

20
00:00:27,918 --> 00:00:29,067
feel it.

21
00:00:29,140 --> 00:00:30,170
Relax.

22
00:00:30,170 --> 00:00:31,670
The Sun's still there.

23
00:00:31,860 --> 00:00:33,000
Probably.

